st organize the event for your  team where then you organize everything  and then the team goes maybe to an  off-site and evening or some Reds just  to have a good time and then hopefully  everybody comes back in the office next  day and it feels like more bonded a  better team to everybody this could be  one example or maybe you organize some  kind of sports event in your office or  you take ownership of any kind of other  initiative that is going on so these are  the things where this is likely going  beyond your job this is not directly  expected from you but you should  ownership mutual initiative you show  that you want to contribute beyond of  what is necessarily directly expected  from you and by that this will be  visible right of you know you have 40  minute and and he would see that now the  team has gone to the team event with or  without him he were very quickly picked  up who that also organized that and who  made this effort for better team  experience for everybody and of course  your main roads your main  responsibilities will always be more  important don't do these things if they  put you in danger of actually delivering  against the things that you're really  supposed to do and that are really  expected from you because if you do that  then it doesn't really matter if you  organize the great team event of your  actual job is not done right so  prioritize correctly but very often you  will find yourself having a bit of spare  time having a bit of extra capacity that  you could invest in these kind of things  and then it is super value but if you do  that if you take initiative take  leadership and then do something good  for the organization this will be  recognized and this for sure will put  you on the list of these more senior  leaders and then make you more visible  so let's recap visibility is super  important and it means how visible you  are to the senior leaders in your  organization do they know that you exist  do they know what you are doing for the  team do they know why you really add  value to the organization as a whole  perception is reality doesn't matter  it's not enough if you do just a good  job you need to make sure that other  people understand and perceive that you  do a good job otherwise it's just not  worth a lot so make sure that this  perception is there make sure that you  are visible I hope if you follow these  tips that this will help you and if you  really enjoyed this please click the  like button and subscribe to this  channel below this would really mean a  lot to me if you just subscribe to my  channel I have many more content pieces  lined up for in the next days or weeks  so I would love to keep you here on the  channel thank you this is Jaime from  from learning
 

